  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the cataplana over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the Italian sausage and cook until browned.",
    "Add the Arborio rice and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the warm chicken broth, one cup at a time, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the cinnamon stick and cook for 20 minutes or until the rice is tender.",
    "Remove the cinnamon stick and stir in the grated Parmesan.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
